guide butler-routes-completionist/hillsbrad-horde-rares
title Hillsbrad Foothills (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 19-32
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords hillsbrad, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

# Hillsbrad (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack
# butler-routes-completionist, v1). An opportunistic sweep for the 7
# confirmed in-band rares a Horde player can actually engage and the
# zone's fixed containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of
# the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is
# not up never holds the route. Spawn points, levels and loot are the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items
# whose SOLE dropper is the rare. The two Alliance-aligned rares
# (Spellscribe, Tamra) are killable opposition for Horde players and say
# so. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any core-
# contracted quest. The Keg that starts the core's Ruined Kegs is that
# quest's object-start and is not covered here. Atrexis (96986's ender)
# has no spawn anywhere and carries no usable point - logged in the
# inventory, never a step. See
# docs/hillsbrad-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory
# this guide was built against.

step Dalaran Spellscribe - the far west

  goto 8.9,23.8
  kill 1920 optional
  collect 4436 "Jewel-encrusted Sash" optional
  collect 4437 "Channeler's Staff" optional
  note Level 21 rare caster, flagged rare in the data, out by the Dalaran crater.
  note Flagged Alliance-faction in the data: an enemy to Horde players - expect opposition.
  note The sash and staff drop nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Tamra Stormpike - the southeastern hills

  loop
  goto 70.68,78.05
  goto 72.31,82.34
  goto 73.25,81.09
  kill 14275 optional
  collect 282710 "Dun Garok Rifle" optional
  note Level 28 rare, flagged rare in the data, working its 3 confirmed points in the southeastern hills.
  note Flagged Alliance-faction in the data: an enemy to Horde players - expect opposition.
  note The rifle drops nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Scargil - the southwest shore

  goto 29.08,73.56
  kill 14276 optional
  collect 282716 "Imbued Scaled Cuffs" optional
  note Level 30 rare, flagged rare in the data, on the southwest shore.
  note The cuffs drop nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ro'Bark - the eastern gnolls

  goto 65.72,60.15
  kill 14278 optional
  collect 282721 "Gnash Shaman's Staff" optional
  note Level 28 rare, flagged rare in the data, with the eastern gnolls.
  note The staff drops nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Creepthess - the western fields

  goto 38.6,58.37
  kill 14279 optional
  collect 282720 "Spider Swarm" optional
  note Level 24 rare, flagged rare in the data, in the western fields.
  note The swarm drops nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Big Samras - the Dun Garok approach

  goto 86.03,39.93
  kill 14280 optional
  collect 282717 "Durable Bearhide Pauldrons" optional
  note Level 27 rare, flagged rare in the data, on the Dun Garok approach.
  note The pauldrons drop nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Jimmy the Bleeder - the northern hills

  goto 60.1,9.1
  kill 14281 optional
  collect 282713 "Bloodstained Pants" optional
  note Level 23 rare, flagged rare in the data, in the northern hills.
  note The pants drop nowhere else. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

