  note Seven Hidden Strongbox placements in the far west, eighteen Solid Chest placements across the zone, thirty-three Barrel of Melon Juice and forty-four Food Crate placements, five Barrel of Milk placements, twenty-six Alliance Chest placements (no faction lock in the data - openable by Horde), four Alliance Strongbox placements, one Ambermill Strongbox, eighteen Battered Footlocker placements at the Syndicate camp, two Camp Crates and one Unopened Crate. All hold ordinary low-level goods; no unique treasure confirmed.
  note No contract quest takes an object objective from any of these containers. The Keg that starts the core's Ruined Kegs is that quest's object-start and is not covered here. Respawn timers unconfirmed.

step Shindigger Kegs - the Dun Garok approach

  loop
  goto 71.53,80.88
  goto 71.62,80.15
  goto 72.02,81.16
  goto 72.44,79.79
  goto 72.69,80.08
  interact 1727 optional
  note Five Kegs of Shindigger Stout on the Dun Garok approach - a Horde-usable drink source the Alliance companion does not cover. Same class as the Milk barrel above: fixed points, no faction lock, no quest link. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
